  "interpretation": [
    "The original release pair-window test completed without perf sampling in 275.130557088 seconds under its unchanged 660-second execution budget. All 15 original producer commands returned zero, including both strict Clippy checks; all 22 executed Rust tests passed.",
    "All three waves have exactly 1000 unique real ready flows, twenty original leases and twenty multiplex controls. Each wave passes the original before-and-after 1000-active-target assertion and two-second hold, exact 16-byte payload/echo, EOF, control closure, original durable resource accounting assertions and drain.",
    "After every wave, each pair's original resource-scope assertion requires zero outstanding bytes and active grants, with cumulative spent_bytes 1600, 3200 and 4800 respectively. The samples follow those passed assertions; no separate numerical four-scope telemetry is claimed.",
    "The final physical cleanup sample follows successful original host shutdown, backend active==0, acknowledged target-listener cancellation, and exact UDP and TCP address rebinding. Final FD26 and RSS252228 kB are retained as observations, without claiming process-wide zero descriptors or memory.",
    "The same-source perf diagnostic remains diagnostic_only with passed=false/AC68false; this independent no-sampling receipt has passed=true. Its target hash differs because it uses the ordinary release profile without the diagnostic debug/strip overrides.",
    "Setup wall time is 244.715 seconds, including the unchanged four 61-second rate-limit waits. Wave open_seconds includes its original hold. These short single-run timings are observations, not a causal speedup or a statistical performance claim."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Every historical failure remains failed and retained, including the original debug workload, earlier release pair-window and origin-window attempts, f3cfb45's expired-authority hold failure, and the e226eec/efebb7b diagnostic failures.",
    "This success qualifies only the exact source and original multiplexed release pair-window scenario. It does not qualify debug performance, the independent-grant mode or other opening schedules.",
    "One hosted process with 100 enrolled space installations is not 100 independent physical devices or relay runtimes and does not measure loaded external management/relay machines.",
    "Cross-day soak, every bounded queue, all physical-network and complete end-to-end cases remain separate; the complete AC68 group is not passed by this workload alone.",
    "No perf sampling, call graph, per-query timings or mutex/admission wait timings were collected in this ordinary qualification run.",
    "The temporary dispatch ref is retained only as provenance in the original official receipt. A read-only remote-head inventory after execution found only main; no branch mutation was performed by this evidence task."
